<title>EGYPT: Egypt all-share index at ninth straight high.</title>
<headline>Egypt all-share index at ninth straight high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index closed on Wednesday at a record high for the ninth straight day, at 324.83 points, up 0.05 on 324.78 at the close on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The index has risen 15.3 percent in the past month.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
